module jev_calibration_closure_observer

input source_version
input contract_version
input declaration
input ir
input generated
input action
input reverse_observation
input evidence_prefix

status BOUND when chained digests and producer states match
status UNKNOWN when evidence is missing or tampered
status DEFERRED when a producer is not explicitly BOUND

constraint read_only
constraint non_authorizing
constraint non_executing
constraint preserve_missing_stage_index